WEBVTT

00:08:58.063 --> 00:09:00.530
identify if they are your
values and standards

00:09:00.563 --> 00:09:02.963
or someone else's
that you have internalized

00:09:02.997 --> 00:09:05.963
and then try to sit with what's important
to you in that moment

00:09:05.997 --> 00:09:08.530
before you decide
what your next step should be.

00:09:08.563 --> 00:09:09.730
CSB: Fantastic.

00:09:09.763 --> 00:09:12.397
Well, thank you so much, Sahaj,
for sharing all this,

00:09:12.397 --> 00:09:14.030
and for your wisdom.

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:15.797
Take care, thanks for joining us.

00:09:15.797 --> 00:09:17.630
SKK: Thank you so much for having me.